  "analysis_md": "设 $S(z)=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{z^n}{n}$，则 $S\\prime(z)=\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}z^{n-1}=\\frac1{1-z}$，$|z|<1,S(0)=0$，故 $S(z)=\\int_0^z\\frac1{1-\\xi}d\\xi=-\\ln(1-z),\\ |z|<1$。",
